<title>USA: Burlington wins 2yr TRW air freight.</title>
<headline>Burlington wins 2yr TRW air freight.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Burlington Air Express said it has been awarded a two year contract for the worldwide movement of TRW Inc heavyweight air cargo.</p>
<p>The value of the contract was not disclosed.</p>
<p>The agreement covers all TRW air shipments over 50 pounds in weight for both domestic overnight air freight and second day air delivery, as well as U.S. exports and imports, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44-171-542-7706 Fax 5017</p>
